<div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
  <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">Register early career teachers APIs</h1>

  <p>
    Use the Register early career teachers (RECT) APIs to integrate your service with 
    Register early career teachers.
  </p>

  <p>
    These APIs allow authorised services to securely access and exchange information 
    about early career teachers, mentors and their induction and training.
  </p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Authentication</h2>

  <p>
    Learn how to authenticate with the RECT APIs, including how to register your 
    application, obtain access tokens and access APIs on behalf of an organisation.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to("Read the authentication guidance", "#authentication") %>
  </p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Hello World API</h2>

  <p>
    Use the Hello World API to test your integration with RECT before integrating 
    with other APIs.
  </p>

  <p>
    It provides simple endpoints for checking that your application can connect to 
    RECT and authenticate using client credentials or a user access token.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to("View the Hello World API", "#hello-world") %>
  </p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Training API</h2>

  <p>
    Use the Training API to manage and exchange information about the training 
    of early career teachers and mentors.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to("View the Training API", api_docs_training_guidance_path) %>
  </p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Induction API</h2>

  <p>
    Use the Induction API to manage and exchange information about the statutory 
    induction of early career teachers.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to("View the Induction API", "#induction") %> 
  </p>
</div>
